      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REBORN PULSE (3) racing well without winning and has a strong place strike-rate, with five minors from six starts. Although beaten into third last start did run very good time (30.70). Makes plenty of appeal. PERCENT (7) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (22.81) at Gosford in a Maiden. Lines up from box 7 for the first time. Goes very well here finding the frame in each of three starts. Expected to feature. RIPPER MULWEE (1) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Festival Rush (16.10) in a Maiden. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Bold showing expected.",
